# Auto push and deploy

The user wants every code change in this repo to go live without extra asking.

After you finish a real code change:

1. Stage the relevant files. Never stage `.env` or secrets.
2. Commit on `main` with a short message.
3. Push to `origin main` (`https://github.com/WIIZYDEV01/Head-Boy-BarberPro.git`).
4. Vercel project **head-boy-barberpro-web** deploys automatically from GitHub. Do not create a new Vercel project.

Do not force-push. Do not skip the push after a commit unless GitHub auth failed.